        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To enable our talent to actively contribute to, and have a positive impact on our overall business, we develop and maintain programs and initiatives ranging from competitive compensation and benefits offerings to goal and performance management.",
        "start_character": 19835,
        "end_character": 20080
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-076549",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-076549-17c7ef6bf54e29bb",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-076549",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We invent, develop, and license fundamental innovations that shape the way millions of people explore and experience entertainment and enhance media services that span billions of devices in an increasingly connected world.",
        "start_character": 6212,
        "end_character": 6435
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-076549",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-076549-17c7ef6bf54e29bb",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-076549",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In order to serve an increasingly connected world, we invent, develop, acquire and license fundamental innovations that enhance billions of devices and shape the way millions of people explore and experience entertainment and technology across a variety of platforms.",
        "start_character": 1336,
        "end_character": 1603
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-076549",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-076549-17c7ef6bf54e29bb",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-076549",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In particular, we are competing for technical talent and we need to offer not only robust and attractive compensation packages but also provide broad opportunities for our employees to make an impact, grow and develop.",
        "start_character": 19457,
        "end_character": 19675
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-076549",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-076549-17c7ef6bf54e29bb",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-076549",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Leveraging the combination of our highly-experienced technologists, scientists and engineers and our advanced research and development (“R&D”) labs, we continue to develop industry-leading 3D integration solutions such as hybrid bonding that meet the demand for greater functionality, higher performance and smaller size for the next generation of electronics.",
        "start_character": 14896,
        "end_character": 15256
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-076549",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-076549-17c7ef6bf54e29bb",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-076549",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We also conduct annual assessments of employees to identify development needs based on department goals.",
        "start_character": 21114,
        "end_character": 21218
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-076549",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-076549-17c7ef6bf54e29bb",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-076549",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are focused on emerging technologies, including hybrid bonding, thermal solutions (like our RapidCool technology), microLEDs and advanced processing nodes, which address semiconductor market demands for higher bandwidth, improved compute performance and cost management with 2.5 and 3D heterogeneous integration.",
        "start_character": 8152,
        "end_character": 8467
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-076549",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-076549-17c7ef6bf54e29bb",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-076549",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We continue to focus our R&D efforts on IP development and next generation technology solutions, including semiconductor hardware research, machine learning, generative AI and advanced algorithm development.",
        "start_character": 17114,
        "end_character": 17321
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-076549",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-076549-17c7ef6bf54e29bb",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-076549",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We have adopted a proactive strategy designed to protect and extend our technology and IP.",
        "start_character": 5514,
        "end_character": 5604
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-076549",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-076549-17c7ef6bf54e29bb",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-076549",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We have spent decades investing in advanced research and development to create market-leading technologies for the entertainment, media, consumer electronics, and semiconductor industries.",
        "start_character": 690,
        "end_character": 878
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-076549",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-076549-17c7ef6bf54e29bb",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-076549",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We invest in the career growth of our employees by providing a wide range of development opportunities, including face-to-face, virtual, social and self-directed learning, mentoring, coaching, training and external development.",
        "start_character": 20886,
        "end_character": 21113
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-076549",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-076549-17c7ef6bf54e29bb",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-076549",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We offer competitive employee benefits that are designed to meet or exceed local requirements.",
        "start_character": 20791,
        "end_character": 20885
